=C2=A0
Kimi K2.7 Code, Moonshot AI's coding-focused agentic model, is now=
 available to run on Ollama's cloud.
=C2=A0
It's hosted in the US on the =
latest NVIDIA B300 datacenter GPUs, and your data stays private and is =
never trained on.
=C2=A0
K2.7 Code improves end-to-end task completion on =
real-world, long-horizon coding tasks while using approximately 30% fewer
thinking tokens. It supports a 256K token context window with vision input.
=C2=A0


Try Kimi K2.7 Code

Download Ollama [https://ollama.com/download]

=C2=A0
To use Kimi K2.7 Code with Claude Code, run:
ollama launch claude --model kimi-k2.7-code:cloud
=C2=A0
For use with Codex:
ollama launch codex --model kimi-k2.7-code:cloud
=C2=A0
For use with Codex desktop:
ollama launch codex-app --model kimi-k2.=
7-code:cloud
=C2=A0
For use with OpenCode:
ollama launch opencode --model =
kimi-k2.7-code:cloud
=C2=A0
For use with Cline CLI:
ollama launch cline --model kimi-k2.7-code:cloud
=C2=A0
Chat with the model:
ollama run kimi-k2.7-code:cloud
=C2=A0
See the model page [https://ollama.com/library/kimi-k2.7-code] for more =
information and integrations.
=C2=A0
If you have any feedback, please reply=
 directly to this email or join Ollama's Discord channel [https://discord.=
gg/ollama].
=C2=A0
